{"title":"2014 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Generalization)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Generalization)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Substitution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Substitution)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Calculus)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Calculus)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The domain of the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/3/6336ff4c2faa4ac6806f29ef9b4477756b51ae3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\log_{\\frac12}(\\log_4(\\log_{\\frac14}(\\log_{16}(\\log_{\\frac1{16}}x))))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -9px\" width=\"304\" height=\"22\" /> is an interval of length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/3/cc39f6ba583f6159aadcb898b5f7677688db8f89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers.  What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/e/17e8a00fffb71af7d3b2d4dcb861e294bd339b91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }19\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }31\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }271\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }319\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }511\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"425\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Generalization.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Generalization)\">Solution 1 (Generalization)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Generalization)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b28547efd22be1c4a05fa193cd7038fc65d71b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/a/91a5b8b0bb9d8e27be1b824f08fd6df60ba1d9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/1/fa1c10f85a3e2fc7ecd4c66c523b0d84be8b7e0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\neq1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" /> note that:\n</p>\n<ol style=\"margin-left: 1.5em;\">\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2aba777fd992fd3f377364f9ee87b24eb98e89b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"45\" height=\"19\" /> is defined if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/7/3470668bb8a39eebcb9ed22863d4c71245731ed9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /></li><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n  </p><li>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/3/073a3779a8a8c7116eec9cb75c7b04242846aeaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;b&lt;1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" /> we conclude that:\n<ul style=\"list-style-type:square;\">\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb5fe8e3837ba7aa5343d55cf68725166ed8bdbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b a&lt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"19\" /> if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/8/2b8cb101d61e55686abe4187d5a33ba9de1b2943.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;b^c.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" /></li><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/f/8cfcf23e7e527cec27f683a1adeb3c40096677ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b a&gt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"19\" /> if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/6/b86162f467368bac905df4f67bec7886f06d672c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;a&lt;b^c.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" /></li><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p></ul>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/1/2210e1c13767dc4524e3c1415bacd736c6a76317.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"16\" /> we conclude that:\n</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type:square;\">\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb5fe8e3837ba7aa5343d55cf68725166ed8bdbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b a&lt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"19\" /> if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/6/b86162f467368bac905df4f67bec7886f06d672c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;a&lt;b^c.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" /></li><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/f/8cfcf23e7e527cec27f683a1adeb3c40096677ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b a&gt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"19\" /> if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/8/2b8cb101d61e55686abe4187d5a33ba9de1b2943.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;b^c.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" /></li><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p></ul>\n</li></ol>\n<p>Therefore, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/5/8e580cbcc7b486f72fc7ac965baa36e36396b5ac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\log_{\\frac12}(\\log_4(\\log_{\\frac14}(\\log_{16}(\\log_{\\frac1{16}}x)))) \\text{ is defined} &amp;\\implies \\log_4(\\log_{\\frac14}(\\log_{16}(\\log_{\\frac1{16}}x)))&gt;0 \\\\ &amp;\\implies \\log_{\\frac14}(\\log_{16}(\\log_{\\frac1{16}}x))&gt;1 \\\\ &amp;\\implies 0&lt;\\log_{16}(\\log_{\\frac1{16}}x)&lt;\\frac14 \\\\ &amp;\\implies 1&lt;\\log_{\\frac1{16}}x&lt;2 \\\\ &amp;\\implies \\frac{1}{256}&lt;x&lt;\\frac{1}{16}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"599\" height=\"166\" />\nThe domain of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is an interval of length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/5/e05471e6cdb3196639b3d65a55cf2cf6aace7e29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{16}-\\frac{1}{256}=\\frac{15}{256},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"138\" height=\"38\" /> from which the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efe8c48d823360f3dc3dc6d95998e720796072fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15+256=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }271}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"172\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p><u><b>Remark</b></u>\n</p><p>This problem is quite similar to <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">2004 AMC 12A Problem 16</a>.\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Substitution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Substitution)\">Solution 2 (Substitution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Substitution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For simplicity, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/3/183566e38c3c02b59f56cfbab95a0de7d5d5be2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\log_{\\frac{1}{16}}{x},b=\\log_{16}a,c=\\log_{\\frac{1}{4}}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -9px\" width=\"262\" height=\"21\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/354ceee4b2b0ead60a3835e586281863061e07ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=\\log_4c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>The domain of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/b/c5b1dee2b02b8d0b77ea47cd731be8c173f945a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{\\frac{1}{2}}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"47\" height=\"21\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccb03a6208651e197bd24a899b4ff4f21bef6d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\in (0, \\infty)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/d/28dadc4562673577a12d60b1715821a2cf5ce098.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d \\in (0, \\infty)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" />.\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/3/1f308b6c9f175e7beaf57867546f27e2d649494a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_4{c} \\in (0, \\infty) \\Rightarrow c \\in (1, \\infty)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"219\" height=\"18\" />.\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/c/68cd5e975272c557bb10d2bcc809655d80ec120d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\log_{\\frac{1}{4}}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"77\" height=\"21\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/6/6f6a2fe3849c85eb7e357786a03b679389fa5344.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\in \\left(0, \\left(\\frac{1}{4}\\right)^1\\right)=\\left(0, \\frac{1}{4}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"199\" height=\"53\" />.\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/7/717825f732496c060a0b95473a29b8da041963d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\log_{16}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/e/8fe352135762a595f66958c59d1d0ccdfff9cc13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\in (16^0,16^{1/4})=(1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"20\" />.\nFinally, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/5/8d5d8814372d775d39371606a79c48c269ba6372.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\log_{\\frac{1}{16}}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -9px\" width=\"86\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/0/c80dae91a452e8bc8290c3b4019a53f419f0a2c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\in \\left(\\left(\\frac{1}{16}\\right)^2,\\left(\\frac{1}{16}\\right)^1\\right)=\\left(\\frac{1}{256},\\frac{1}{16}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"297\" height=\"55\" />.\n</p><p>The length of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> interval is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/6/f36b2bf711e8e2da2b626b2e8bab98b3b8a7a9f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{16}-\\frac{1}{256}=\\frac{15}{256}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"129\" height=\"38\" /> and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/f/e1f95118c87dd1bc28b2ea1b46202ffd6d157442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }271}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"75\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Calculus.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Calculus)\">Solution 3 (Calculus)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Calculus)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The domain of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is the range of the inverse function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/c/6bc2d4ab741a784b3d9bb03f2aad46e4d81e6774.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{-1}(x)=\\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^{16^{\\left(\\frac14\\right)^{4^{\\left(\\frac12\\right)^x}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"198\" height=\"73\" />. Now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/1/691e68724f84728d34175b89c9df0eca53b2bbe5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{-1}(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"19\" /> can be seen to be strictly decreasing, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/d/d2db487b99352510027ca7ecd5a79f423665f798.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac12\\right)^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"46\" height=\"44\" /> is decreasing, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/1/e01e9b94115f6afcacf612a3fc0369bee936d416.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{\\left(\\frac12\\right)^x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"20\" /> is decreasing, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/3053c6dcea75faceb1800d86e07a39f925fdbcba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac14\\right)^{4^{\\left(\\frac12\\right)^x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"75\" height=\"58\" /> is increasing, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/5/d35b3eb5d5bc1499c44d551e0cff6c3401aefe7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16^{\\left(\\frac14\\right)^{4^{\\left(\\frac12\\right)^x}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"35\" /> is increasing, therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/a/6da9d1a42946353a0367c1faa74f708f57ecbc19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^{16^{\\left(\\frac14\\right)^{4^{\\left(\\frac12\\right)^x}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"121\" height=\"73\" /> is decreasing.\n</p><p>Therefore, the range of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/1/691e68724f84728d34175b89c9df0eca53b2bbe5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{-1}(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"19\" /> is the open interval <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/0/5b059015eb564032be090f8459a624ed2a4ec5fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}f^{-1}(x), \\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}f^{-1}(x)\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"221\" height=\"43\" />. We find:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/9/789a87855541f97b80e934bf045d36817bb0a5e7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}    \\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^{16^{\\left(\\frac14\\right)^{4^{\\left(\\frac12\\right)^x}}}}&amp;= \\lim_{a\\to\\infty}\\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^{16^{\\left(\\frac14\\right)^{4^a}}}\\\\ &amp;= \\lim_{b\\to\\infty}\\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^{16^{\\left(\\frac14\\right)^b}}\\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^{16^0}\\\\ &amp;= \\frac{1}{16}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"330\" height=\"238\" />\nSimilarly,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b10bf74166dfce2d09698f95777a606ce78f857.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^{16^{\\left(\\frac14\\right)^{4^{\\left(\\frac12\\right)^x}}}}&amp;=\\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^{16^{\\left(\\frac14\\right)^{4^0}}}\\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^{16^{\\frac14}}\\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\frac1{16}\\right)^2\\\\ &amp;= \\frac{1}{256}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"282\" height=\"228\" />\nHence the range of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/1/691e68724f84728d34175b89c9df0eca53b2bbe5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{-1}(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"19\" /> (which is then the domain of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/857989b4cc90489bb9fedd684665abf5eee2b949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{1}{256},\\frac{1}{16}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"84\" height=\"43\" /> and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/f/e1f95118c87dd1bc28b2ea1b46202ffd6d157442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }271}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"75\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_.28English-Chinese_Bilingual.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/M5K7UvZuPMc\">https://youtu.be/M5K7UvZuPMc</a>\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A\" title=\"2014 AMC 12A\">2014 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2014 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/ind